        "execSummary":  "The decision-relevant point for enterprise AI leaders: the return on AI investment is gated by data traceability, not model capability. Organizations pouring budget into frontier models while neglecting data identity reconciliation across systems will find AI outputs they cannot audit, defend, or act on with confidence. The key implication: before scaling AI, leaders must map data lineage and enforce cross-system identity governance, or risk deploying sophisticated tools on a foundation that cannot be trusted.",
