        "execSummary":  "This piece captures a structural tension every enterprise AI leader faces: the business demands speed while AI\u0027s non-deterministic behavior demands caution. The leading CIOs interviewed are resolving this by decoupling innovation from oversight ΓÇö standing up fast-moving AI labs with their own sandbox environments while maintaining a separate governance function that sets guardrails and reviews outputs before production release. The maturity model framing is particularly useful: it gives organizations a structured path from early experimentation to scaled deployment without collapsing governance under pressure. The key caveat is that this dual-track structure only works if both tracks are adequately resourced ΓÇö underfunding compliance while racing to ship is still a losing strategy.",
