        "summary":  "Over 40% of enterprise decision-makers report that AI-related incidents cost their organizations $2 million or more annually, according to a WitnessAI survey. IT and infrastructure departments are paradoxically the leading source of shadow AI ΓÇö unsanctioned AI tool usage within corporations. Despite significant security risks, enterprises continue accelerating AI adoption, with worker access surging 50% in 2025.",
