        "summary":  "SnapLogic unveiled SnapGPT, an agentic assistant that guides enterprise teams through the complete integration lifecycle using natural language. The tool leverages agentic planning, integration-specific reasoning, pipeline execution validation, and over 15 years of enterprise integration expertise to help organizations move from business requirements to production faster. SnapGPT supports four key phases: planning requirements, building production-ready integrations, understanding existing assets, and operating systems with AI-powered diagnostics.",
